==English==

===Etymology===
{{term|hunter}} + {{term|gatherer}} 

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[member]] of a group of people who live by [[hunt]]ing [[animals]] and [[gather]]ing [[edible]] [[plant]]s for their main food sources, and who do not keep animals or [[farm]] [[land]].

